ld&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5c74ab3b88173ba582d1746e100cac7b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Psydeworks/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/65d59fb5/uploads/origins/fdf2bb5e-8f33-49fa-a874-add20cfb48c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4346748c39b3c30e74b6a7c6c61c4de2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/65d59fb5/uploads/origins/fdf2bb5e-8f33-49fa-a874-add20cfb48c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4346748c39b3c30e74b6a7c6c61c4de2, https://si.imgix.net/65d59fb5/uploads/origins/fdf2bb5e-8f33-49fa-a874-add20cfb48c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57979c72ed24789c3cdf6fe82617b02d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/65d59fb5/uploads/origins/fdf2bb5e-8f33-49fa-a874-add20cfb48c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f9cb6825e8f4040f0693ba96df14b75 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! °▽°)╯\nI absolutely love your art style and coloring! The colors are stunning, and your works always catch my eye! I’d love to commission you for an illustration as a birthday gift for myself🎂.\nDetails:\nOC have Orange eyes, long wavy blue hair (waist-length), pale cool-toned skin。\n❗ If possible,i hope you could add suitable lipstick and blue nail polish for her.\nTheme: Balloon Party 🎈\nThe OC's setting is that she is a puppet from an abandoned circus. Every day, she lures lost people into the circus, and after the performance, she turns them into puppets—so she will never be alone.\nIf possible, I’d love for there to be some balloons in the illustration, and you can freely choose the character’s pose and action.\nYou can select an outfit from the link below for the artwork. If any part is difficult to draw, feel free to simplify or omit it.( •̀ .̫ •́ )✧\nIf the amount is not enough, please do not hesitate to modify it!\nThank you so much!   (〃￣︶￣)人(￣︶￣〃) 💖\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1E9QkW79ydro0VrmkU-BOdgdOr6e3ch8d?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Psydeworks/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d25c3127/uploads/origins/20e45786-0c8d-4b86-b933-ced64ad21f64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ea98a713fe99dd0dd6c99d2a3429ded0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d25c3127/uploads/origins/20e45786-0c8d-4b86-b933-ced64ad21f64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ea98a713fe99dd0dd6c99d2a3429ded0, https://si.imgix.net/d25c3127/uploads/origins/20e45786-0c8d-4b86-b933-ced64ad21f64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a48e4872c35619770c69608d367c381c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d25c3127/uploads/origins/20e45786-0c8d-4b86-b933-ced64ad21f64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=518e7e807837dc8986953c1b37734181 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Psydeworks/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d876b870/uploads/origins/5db7c606-1429-459e-84f2-657d1bd907b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29f1b3099fb8ba26121859a394143291", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d876b870/uploads/origins/5db7c606-1429-459e-84f2-657d1bd907b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29f1b3099fb8ba26121859a394143291, https://si.imgix.net/d876b870/uploads/origins/5db7c606-1429-459e-84f2-657d1bd907b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b27007c63cc430b5d3a5b114c9093f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d876b870/uploads/origins/5db7c606-1429-459e-84f2-657d1bd907b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bb07dbb5b1989475e8bafb31a11d8e7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi Sensei,\n\nThank you for the appeal, your art is very cool, and the colouring is amazing. I would be happy to request one for my oc! \n\nI put one of my ocs’ description in the request box, but please feel free to choose any other characters in my profile page!\n\nShe is a non-human girl with horns and long curly hair. Her existence is based on human’s pain, or it can be said that she is the concept of “pain” itself. Her themes include “flower of blood and flesh”, “painful”, “being a prisoner of her own mind”. Please feel free to draw anything you think suits her best! You can also adjust or simplify her clothing if it works better. \n\nYou can find her detailed appearance in the attached link.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1WvCC84lpiVWahpDmlE5elardOUwiE2Zt", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Psydeworks/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3b6ea481/uploads/origins/de61aaca-bfa1-427d-a208-76ca609d6d88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ab444b809ceae196daa78639410c2b2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3b6ea481/uploads/origins/de61aaca-bfa1-427d-a208-76ca609d6d88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ab444b809ceae196daa78639410c2b2, https://si.imgix.net/3b6ea481/uploads/origins/de61aaca-bfa1-427d-a208-76ca609d6d88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db7c440c0af5f958bdad91b7429ff66a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3b6ea481/uploads/origins/de61aaca-bfa1-427d-a208-76ca609d6d88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bbccb43a29358500286e975804e114c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして、貴方様の描くイラストの世界観がとても好きで、陰ながら拝見しておりました。\n今回、自創作を描いていただきたくリクエストを送らせていただきます。\n\n描いていただきたいキャラクター\n\n■白鳥知世\n年齢:27歳  性別:女性\n\n自由奔放だが落ち着きのある外科医。\n･頭の回転が早いため、仕事に関して周りの人間に不満を抱くことも少なくない。\n･ミステリー小説が好きで家の本棚には沢山のミステリー小説がある\n･目的の為なら手段を選ばない\n\n\n\n○使用用途はSNSのアイコンやヘッダー、壁紙、グッズにしてお部屋に飾りたいとも考えております。(個人観賞の為売買の予定はありません)\n\n○首から下げている携帯ゲーム機は省略して無いものとしていただいて構いません。衣服等、随所描きやすいように改変していただければと思います。\n\n○その他希望\n･正面を向いている構図で、ダークで退廃的な世界観にしていただけたらとても嬉しく思います。\n･可能であればメス等の医療器具を持たせていただきたいです。\n(こちらの希望は難しければ無視していただいて構いません。)\n\nこれからも宇宙人Psyderさんの作品を楽しく拝見させていただいております。\n長文失礼いたしました。上記、もし宜しければよろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1dQR9ZDvLQtJqhvFeNxAgnEnaS1GuBNXX", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Psydeworks/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1687512797893316609%2F0USC1AZV.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=147e36cb9ae2c7308464d0386b593b8b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1687512797893316609%2F0USC1AZV.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=147e36cb9ae2c7308464d0386b593b8b, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1687512797893316609%2F0USC1AZV.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6f62a81a32a2e58551bd5e84302a93db 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1687512797893316609%2F0USC1AZV.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6b46a6076538a9655bf27b8fa3775a73 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Psydeworks/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/929f5790/uploads/origins/ce83eddd-4d04-4421-a86a-442ae413d63a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a1db93aaa2d4253e182303662074ab1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/929f5790/uploads/origins/ce83eddd-4d04-4421-a86a-442ae413d63a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a1db93aaa2d4253e182303662074ab1, https://si.imgix.net/929f5790/uploads/origins/ce83eddd-4d04-4421-a86a-442ae413d63a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6132f503d034633ba2d0e7ab00ccbd63 2x, https://si.imgix.net/929f5790/uploads/origins/ce83eddd-4d04-4421-a86a-442ae413d63a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f137be5afdfea5fa3c09a01a202ad8b2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\nI really like your drawings, your mastery and artistic expression.\nI would like you to draw a painting for my oc.\nHere is the basic information about the character：\nGentle personality, always smiling.\nGreen eyes， Pink hair， White skin\n2 moles above the left eye and below the right eye respectively\nRed glove on left hand only\nThe character is a princess born in the spring of an ancient kingdom, who suffers eternal pain due to her father's greed and the curse of the undead. She becomes the Witch of Spring and seeks salvation through the transcendence of the undead.\nI would like to add some plants to the drawing, and I would like to give free rein to the movements and gestures and give free rein to all the costumes according to your preference.\nIf you can accept my invitation, it will be greatly appreciated~~\nIf the amount is not enough, please do not hesitate to modify it.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1mWFyMMdR-6qV1g9pH62lcrTjNLfKcgef", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Psydeworks/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0eae3d9b/uploads/origins/5e0e499b-35d1-4caa-ab46-b3a6781cc8c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59cd780f9834f4606f97efb7d3205bd0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0eae3d9b/uploads/origins/5e0e499b-35d1-4caa-ab46-b3a6781cc8c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59cd780f9834f4606f97efb7d3205bd0, https://si.imgix.net/0eae3d9b/uploads/origins/5e0e499b-35d1-4caa-ab46-b3a6781cc8c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52eeaaf81e2518b64527b383d13975b1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0eae3d9b/uploads/origins/5e0e499b-35d1-4caa-ab46-b3a6781cc8c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d28cbb90742fca6413be886e46854f03 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, I really like your artwork! Are you willing to draw my oc? He is an elegant and beautiful white peacock prince. Thank you!\n\nhttps://x.com/AngelaXu14/status/1765431225265881201?s=20", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Psydeworks/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7e34c068/uploads/origins/7bd0a5d3-0a99-4100-b406-10dea40fa7bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b007335e550514de4189da00b4d11f0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7e34c068/uploads/origins/7bd0a5d3-0a99-4100-b406-10dea40fa7bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b007335e550514de4189da00b4d11f0, https://si.imgix.net/7e34c068/uploads/origins/7bd0a5d3-0a99-4100-b406-10dea40fa7bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d595b75f06a7f028aeeba571fdd7bb5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7e34c068/uploads/origins/7bd0a5d3-0a99-4100-b406-10dea40fa7bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29957d83a4d3e285f8f77b55ce87735d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\n2様に過去にイラストをご依頼させていただいたものです。\nぜひ再度依頼したいと思っていたのですが叶わず、この度お見掛けしたので依頼させていただきました。\nつきまして下記のような内容でご依頼させていただきたく思います。\n\nキャラクター : オリジナルキャラクター　男\nGoogle ドライブ : https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1IcF2Lhw421p8nXgeOBt5iHg99JTx1dlU?usp=sharing\n\n服装 : 参考１のもの\n構図リクエスト : 特になし\n※可能であれば頭部が切れない構図であると嬉しいです。\n納品形式 : 可能であればpsd\n使用用途 : 個人使用　SNS公開予定なし\n\n上記にてご検討いただけましたら幸いです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Psydeworks/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/34d7b978/uploads/origins/c8369aa8-cceb-4373-90e4-d0e88336c69a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fd244095c9be5c7e709b50377f1c61d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/34d7b978/uploads/origins/c8369aa8-cceb-4373-90e4-d0e88336c69a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fd244095c9be5c7e709b50377f1c61d, https://si.imgix.net/34d7b978/uploads/origins/c8369aa8-cceb-4373-90e4-d0e88336c69a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14434772da6e4c3e37d966cb2d6fb54b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/34d7b978/uploads/origins/c8369aa8-cceb-4373-90e4-d0e88336c69a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9763890a25848e88cb15b5dc91e6930d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "宇宙人Psyderさん、はじめまして。冥宮と申します。YouTubeの動画を拝見して以来のファンです。この度私の創作キャラを描いて頂きたくリクエスト失礼します。\n\n【キャラクター設定】\n冥宮　雨音　Meiguu Amane\n身長:163cm 誕生日:10/3 性別:女性\n槍使いの冥界の王。生前学校中を巻き込んで宗教的なものを開き革命を企んだが途中で失敗して冥界に来た。厨二病発症中。自己皇帝感が高い。ブルーベリー系のスイーツが好き。\n\n■キャラデザの細かいところをまとめさせて頂きました\n・前髪、横髪、後ろ髪に青のグラデーションがかかってます。\n・タイトなフィッシュネットのインナーを着ています。(腕の網のやつです。）\n・犬歯が鋭いです。\n\n構図、雰囲気などはおまかせさせて頂きます。\nPsyderさんの構築される世界観が大好きなので、有償依頼やよその子という概念に囚われずお好きなように描いて頂いても構いません。色もPsyderさんの思う色をご自由に使ってください。デザインのアレンジも大歓迎です。\n\n描いて頂いたイラストは印刷して自室に飾らせていただく可能性があるので、ご許可をいただける場合は承認して頂けると嬉しいです。\n楽しんで描いて頂けたら幸いです。